---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Trade Exposure — HormuzTracker.tech" description="Country-by-country trade exposure analysis, oil import dependency, and LNG dependency data affected by the Hormuz crisis." path="/exposure">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-6 space-y-6" id="exposure-page">
    <div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Trade Exposure & Industry Impact</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">How the Hormuz crisis ripples through global industries</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Country-by-Country Oil Import Dependency -->
    <div class="glass-card p-5">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-4">Oil Import Dependency via Hormuz</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-ops-700/50">
              <th class="text-left py-2 text-slate-400 font-medium">Country</th>
              <th class="text-right py-2 text-slate-400 font-medium">bbl/day via Hormuz</th>
              <th class="text-right py-2 text-slate-400 font-medium">Hormuz Dependency</th>
              <th class="text-right py-2 text-slate-400 font-medium">LNG via Hormuz</th>
              <th class="text-center py-2 text-slate-400 font-medium">Risk Level</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody id="country-table"></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Visual Dependency Bars -->
    <div class="glass-card p-5">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-4">Hormuz Dependency by Country</h2>
      <div class="space-y-3" id="dependency-bars"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Industry Supply Chain Pathways -->
    <div class="glass-card p-5">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-4">Industry Supply Chain Pathways</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-4">How the Hormuz disruption cascades through key industries</p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3">
        <div class="bg-ops-900/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-crisis-red/20">
          <div class="text-sm font-bold text-crisis-red mb-1">Oil Refining</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">Feedstock shortage forces throughput cuts. Refineries designed for Gulf crude struggle to process alternative grades. Margins compressed between rising input costs and demand destruction.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-ops-900/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-crisis-red/20">
          <div class="text-sm font-bold text-crisis-red mb-1">Shipping</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">Container rates +180% as Cape detour ties up vessels. Global container shortage as ships delayed on longer routes. Insurance costs make many routes unprofitable.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-ops-900/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-crisis-orange/20">
          <div class="text-sm font-bold text-crisis-orange mb-1">Petrochemicals</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">Naphtha and ethylene feedstock prices surge. Asian petrochemical producers (South Korea, Japan) face existential margin pressure. End-product prices rising through supply chain.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-ops-900/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-crisis-orange/20">
          <div class="text-sm font-bold text-crisis-orange mb-1">LNG & Gas</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">No pipeline bypass for LNG. Qatar force majeure triggers global gas price surge. European energy transition plans disrupted as alternative LNG sources maxed out.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-ops-900/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-crisis-amber/20">
          <div class="text-sm font-bold text-crisis-amber mb-1">Agriculture</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">Fertilizer prices surge (natural gas is key feedstock). Food production costs rising globally. Developing nations most affected by food price inflation.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-ops-900/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-crisis-amber/20">
          <div class="text-sm font-bold text-crisis-amber mb-1">Aviation</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">Jet fuel prices tracking crude upward. Airlines facing 30-50% fuel cost increases. Flight reductions on unprofitable routes. Air cargo rates surging.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-ops-900/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-ops-700/30">
          <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">Pharmaceuticals</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">Petrochemical-derived active ingredients facing supply constraints. Temperature-controlled shipping disrupted. Generic drug manufacturing margins squeezed.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-ops-900/50 rounded-lg p-4 border border-ops-700/30">
          <div class="text-sm font-bold text-white mb-1">Electronics</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">Semiconductor manufacturing energy costs rising. Supply chain delays for components shipped through affected routes. Manufacturing margin pressure in East Asia.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    const countries = [
      { name: 'Japan', flag: '🇯🇵', bblDay: '3.1M', dependency: 88, lngVia: '42%', risk: 'CRITICAL', riskColor: 'crisis-red' },
      { name: 'Saudi Arabia', flag: '🇸🇦', bblDay: '7.2M', dependency: 95, lngVia: '0%', risk: 'CRITICAL', riskColor: 'crisis-red' },
      { name: 'South Korea', flag: '🇰🇷', bblDay: '2.1M', dependency: 73, lngVia: '38%', risk: 'CRITICAL', riskColor: 'crisis-red' },
      { name: 'India', flag: '🇮🇳', bblDay: '2.5M', dependency: 64, lngVia: '15%', risk: 'HIGH', riskColor: 'crisis-orange' },
      { name: 'China', flag: '🇨🇳', bblDay: '4.0M', dependency: 40, lngVia: '12%', risk: 'HIGH', riskColor: 'crisis-orange' },
      { name: 'Singapore', flag: '🇸🇬', bblDay: '1.1M', dependency: 85, lngVia: '25%', risk: 'HIGH', riskColor: 'crisis-orange' },
      { name: 'Taiwan', flag: '🇹🇼', bblDay: '0.9M', dependency: 72, lngVia: '28%', risk: 'HIGH', riskColor: 'crisis-orange' },
      { name: 'Thailand', flag: '🇹🇭', bblDay: '0.8M', dependency: 65, lngVia: '10%', risk: 'MODERATE', riskColor: 'crisis-amber' },
      { name: 'Australia', flag: '🇦🇺', bblDay: '0.4M', dependency: 35, lngVia: '0%', risk: 'MODERATE', riskColor: 'crisis-amber' },
      { name: 'European Union', flag: '🇪🇺', bblDay: '1.8M', dependency: 14, lngVia: '8%', risk: 'MODERATE', riskColor: 'crisis-amber' },
      { name: 'United States', flag: '🇺🇸', bblDay: '0.5M', dependency: 5, lngVia: '0%', risk: 'LOW', riskColor: 'crisis-green' },
      { name: 'Brazil', flag: '🇧🇷', bblDay: '0.3M', dependency: 8, lngVia: '0%', risk: 'LOW', riskColor: 'crisis-green' },
    ];

    // Table
    document.getElementById('country-table').innerHTML = countries.map(c => {
      return `<tr class="border-b border-ops-800/50">
        <td class="py-2 text-white">${c.flag} ${c.name}</td>
        <td class="text-right text-slate-400 font-mono">${c.bblDay}</td>
        <td class="text-right text-${c.riskColor} font-bold">${c.dependency}%</td>
        <td class="text-right text-slate-400 font-mono">${c.lngVia}</td>
        <td class="text-center"><span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs bg-${c.riskColor}/20 text-${c.riskColor}">${c.risk}</span></td>
      </tr>`;
    }).join('');

    // Visual dependency bars
    document.getElementById('dependency-bars').innerHTML = countries.map(c => {
      const barColor = c.dependency >= 70 ? 'bg-crisis-red' : c.dependency >= 40 ? 'bg-crisis-orange' : c.dependency >= 20 ? 'bg-crisis-amber' : 'bg-crisis-green';
      return `<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <div class="w-28 text-xs text-slate-300 font-medium text-right">${c.flag} ${c.name.length > 10 ? c.name.substring(0, 10) + '…' : c.name}</div>
        <div class="flex-1 bg-ops-800 rounded-full h-5 overflow-hidden">
          <div class="h-full ${barColor} rounded-full flex items-center pl-2 transition-all duration-700" style="width: ${c.dependency}%">
            <span class="text-[10px] text-white font-bold">${c.dependency}%</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="w-16 text-xs text-slate-500 text-right font-mono">${c.bblDay}</div>
      </div>`;
    }).join('');
  </script>
</Layout>
